#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node changed after the page was drawn, so nothing was done. Review it and try again."
msgstr "Niova ny node taorian'ny fanehoana ny pejy, ka tsy nisy na inona na inona natao. Jereo indray izany ary andramo indray."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not allow changing this record."
msgstr "Tsy mamela anao hanova ity firaketana ity ny fahazoan-dalanao momba ny fitaovana."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Name: another fabric already uses this name."
msgstr "Anarana: efa mampiasa io anarana io ny fabric iray hafa."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Adapter: another fabric already sweeps this adapter port on this poller. One fabric per adapter port."
msgstr "Adapter: efa misava ity seranan'ny adapter ity amin'ity poller ity ny fabric iray hafa. Fabric iray isaky ny seranan'ny adapter."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be saved."
msgstr "Tsy azo tehirizina ny fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "Voatahiry ny fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "Mandeha ny fisavana ity fabric ity, ka tsy nisy zavatra voafafa. Andramo indray rehefa vita izany."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "Voafafa ny fabric sy ny lisitry ny singany. Tsy nisy fitaovana Cacti novana ary tsy nifandraisana ny fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be deleted."
msgstr "Tsy azo nofafana ny fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was not changed."
msgstr "Tsy novana ny famantarana ny node."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was updated. It is swept again from the next cycle."
msgstr "Nohavaozina ny famantarana ny node. Hosavaina indray izany manomboka amin'ny tsingerina manaraka."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device mapping moved to the new node."
msgstr "Nafindra tany amin'ny node vaovao ny fampifandraisana ny fitaovana."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be confirmed. The nodes may have changed since it was made."
msgstr "Tsy azo nohamarinina ny tolo-kevitra. Mety niova ny node hatramin'ny nanaovana azy."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be rejected."
msgstr "Tsy azo nolavina ny tolo-kevitra."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal was rejected."
msgstr "Nolavina ny tolo-kevitra."

#: fabric_admin.php
#, php-format
msgid "The node mapping was not changed. %s"
msgstr "Tsy novana ny fampifandraisana ny node. %s"

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node mapping was not changed."
msgstr "Tsy novana ny fampifandraisana ny node."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node mapping was saved."
msgstr "Voatahiry ny fampifandraisana ny node."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "No device was created. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Tsy nisy fitaovana noforonina. Jereo ny firaketana Cacti."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device was created and the node mapped to it. Choose the ports to graph on the New Graphs page."
msgstr "Noforonina ny fitaovana ary nampifandraisina taminy ny node. Fidio ao amin'ny pejy New Graphs ireo seranana hanaovana tabilao."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The inventory could not be read for export."
msgstr "Tsy azo novakina ho amin'ny fanondranana ny lisitry ny singa."

#: fabric_health.php
msgid "The Fabric templates and data query file were installed."
msgstr "Napetraka ireo modely Fabric sy ny rakitra fangatahana angona."

#: fabric_health.php
msgid "The Fabric templates were not installed. See the Cacti Objects table and the Cacti log."
msgstr "Tsy napetraka ireo modely Fabric. Jereo ny tabilao Cacti Objects sy ny firaketana Cacti."

