#: lib/HealthPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Fabric %s: it is assigned to poller %d, but only the main poller can sweep a fabric until remote poller support is added. It is not swept; assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "Fabric %s: voatendry amin'ny poller %d izy io, nefa ny poller fototra ihany no afaka misava fabric mandra-panampiana ny fanohanana poller lavitra. Tsy voasava izany; tendreo amin'ny poller fototra izany."

