msgid "Transmit wait counts ticks in which a port had data to send but could not send it, for lack of credits or arbitration. A high value shows congestion toward the remote end; it does not show that the port or its cable is faulty. The tick length is not published for current link speeds, so values are ticks per second, not time."
msgstr "Ny fiandrasana fandefasana dia manisa ny ticks izay nananan'ny seranana angona halefa nefa tsy afaka nandefa izany, noho ny tsy fahampian'ny credits na ny arbitration. Ny sanda ambony dia mampiseho fitohanana mankany amin'ny ilany lavitra; tsy mampiseho izany fa simba ny seranana na ny taribiny. Tsy navoaka ny halavan'ny tick ho an'ny hafainganam-pandehan'ny rohy ankehitriny, ka ticks isan-tsegondra ny sanda fa tsy fotoana."

