msgstr "Fampitandremana tsy fantatra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Fitaovana fitiliana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Lahatahiry feno, eo amin'ny poller tsirairay mitily ny fabric, izay misy ny perfquery, ibnetdiscover, ary iblinkinfo. Ny fonosana Debian sy Ubuntu dia mametraka azy ireo ao amin'ny /usr/sbin. Tsy misy programa hafa ampandehanina avy ao mihitsy."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Lahatahirin'ny fitaovana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Sarin-tany anaran'ny tendro"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Lalana feno tsy voatery mankany amin'ny rakitra sarin-tany anaran'ny tendro infiniband-diags. Ny anarana omeny ihany no aseho; ny GUID-n'ny tendro foana no famantarana."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Fe-potoana faran'ny datagram"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Milisegondra azon'ny datagram fitantanana tsirairay raisina alohan'ny hanandraman'ny fitaovana azy indray (ny safidy -t an'izy ireo)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Fe-potoana faran'ny baiko"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Segondra azon'ny fandehanan'ny fitaovana iray raisina alohan'ny hampijanona azy sy hiraketana azy ho tsy nahomby."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB azon'ny fandehanan'ny fitaovana iray avoaka. Ny vokatra lehibe kokoa dia ariana ary voarakitra ho tsy nahomby."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Vokatra ambony indrindra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Fitiliana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Fetr'ora isaky ny tendro"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Segondra azon'ny fitiliana tendro iray laniana amin'ny famakiana mpanisa. Ny seranana tsy tratra dia vakina amin'ny tsingerina manaraka."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Isan'ny seranana tsy nahomby izay mampijanona ny fitiliana tendro amin'ity tsingerina ity. Ny seranana tsy mamaly dia mandany segondra maromaro."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Fetran'ny tsy fahombiazan'ny tendro"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Raketo ny seranana tsy mandeha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanontaniana angona Seranana Fabric dia mitanisa ihany koa ireo seranana tsy mandeha sy tsy manana farany lavitra, toy ny seranana mpandrindra tsy ampiasaina. Rehefa tsy voamarika, dia avela izy ireo mandra-pandehany indray."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Fanesorana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Tazomy ny tabilaon'ny plugin rehefa manaisotra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanesorana ny plugin dia mitazona ny fabric, ny lisitra, ary ny santionany. Esory ny marika mba hamafan'ny fanesorana azy ireo; aondrano aloha ny lisitra avy ao amin'ny pejy Fitantanana Fabric. Tsy ifandraisana mihitsy ny fabric na amin'ny fomba ahoana na amin'ny fomba ahoana."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Ny lahatahirin'ny fitaovana dia tsy maintsy lalana feno ahitana litera, isa, teboka, tsipika, tsipika ambany, ary tsipika mitongilana, ary tsy misy tsipika mitongilana any amin'ny farany."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Tsy misy ny lahatahirin'ny fitaovana na tsy lahatahiry izy io."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Misy rohy an'ohatra (symbolic link) ny lalan'ny lahatahirin'ny fitaovana. Ampidiro ny tena lalana."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Tsy an'ny root ny lahatahirin'ny fitaovana."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Ny lahatahirin'ny fitaovana dia azon'ny vondrony na ny hafa soratana."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "Misy fitaovana fitiliana tsy an'ny root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Misy fitaovana fitiliana azon'ny vondrony na ny hafa soratana."

